## Install & use

This directory is a build artifact — the host won't load a skill from here. To make it actually invocable by an agent, copy the skill directory into the host's skills directory:

```bash
# User-level (usable from every project)
cp -r {{skill-slug-1}} ~/.claude/skills/

# Or project-level
cp -r {{skill-slug-1}} <project>/.claude/skills/    # Claude Code
cp -r {{skill-slug-1}} <project>/.cursor/skills/    # Cursor
```

---

## Feeding into darwin-skill

Every skill ships with a `test-prompts.json` (darwin-skill compatible format), so you can plug straight into automatic evolution:

```
darwin evolve books/{{book-slug}}/
```

Optional: <https://github.com/alchaincyf/darwin-skill>

